Union shorthand for 'a concept reference (skos:Concept) OR a defined term (schema:DefinedTerm)'. In JSON instances the value MAY be: (a) an inline object typed as Concept / DefinedTerm, (b) an @id-only object referencing one, or (c) a plain string interpreted as the @id / prefLabel / termCode of the referenced concept or term.
</body>
